 your patients don't have much.","TextTheyVersion":"No, I mean... I know your patients don't have much."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2375.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"20666","byteOffset":15702824,"byteLength":360}},{"id":"DFr_2C5FFDCB","articyId":"72057606922878468","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Dr Fred Matombo","text":"We look after each other down here. Despite what CorpSec orders.","speakerId":"Ntt_59509508","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"We look after each other down here. Despite what CorpSec orders.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":2675.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"38476","byteOffset":28890672,"byteLength":372}},{"id":"DFr_6817CBF8","articyId":"72057606922878475","type":"choice","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Player","text":"Feels like the right thing to do.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Feels like the right thing to do.","TextSheVersion":"Feels like the right thing to do.","TextTheyVersion":"Feels like the right thing to do."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2975.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"39800","byteOffset":29387248,"byteLength":344}},{"id":"DFr_CF23AE13","articyId":"72057606922878482","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Dr Fred Matombo","text":"Right. So take the money and bank it, yes?","speakerId":"Ntt_59509508","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Right. So take the money and bank it, yes?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3275.0,"y":475.0},"so